#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:19
msgid "From documents to executable rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:21
msgid ""
"The offline asset set is unusually broad. The reviewed inventory counts "
"876 official AEAT artefacts, 124 manual source/extraction artefacts, 18 "
"large normalized manual texts, 22 worked-example files, 443 parsed "
"normative JSON extractions, 2,140 AEAT registry files, 166 terminology "
"concepts and 332 locale YAML files across four languages. The registry "
"spans 58 models and 68 named revisions. Those counts are inventory "
"evidence, not a completeness score: semantic inspection of large "
"documents and formula/export declarations was representative, while "
"source-digest matching and syntax parsing covered more of the inventory. "
"The worked examples' 85 expected outcomes are bounded oracles "
"concentrated on Modelo 100, not proof of every model/year branch. "
"[Knowledge topic](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-localization.md), "
"[corpus review](../articles/192-aeat-official-reference-corpus.md), "
"[manual review](../articles/196-aeat-practical-manual-corpus.md), "
"[registry review](../articles/203-aeat-registry-and-model-"
"declarations.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:23
msgid ""
"Source and edition coordinates matter. A manual may describe the 2020, "
"2024 or 2025 tax year, or only a regional part; a 2026 order may govern a"
" later filing design. The normalized text files preserve a source digest "
"and extraction platform but flatten pages/sections into one string. "
"Sampled text has U+FFFE split marks inside ordinary words, and one "
"normalized normative record contains apparently unrelated text whose "
"origin was not resolved. A consolidated BOE page's update/no-legal-value "
"notice may not survive extraction. A search hit or quoted excerpt "
"therefore needs its underlying source, date, jurisdiction and page/table "
"context before becoming a legal explanation. The corpus text resolver "
"narrows a citation to one extracted unit and refuses duplicate/missing "
"anchors; a corpus bundle manifest proves internal hash consistency but "
"not publisher authenticity. [Manual text](../articles/201-aeat-manuals-"
"extracted-text.md), [normative text](../articles/202-normative-pdf-text-"
"corpus.md), citation resolver (`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`), bundle"
" verifier (`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_manifest/manifest.py`), [core "
"topic](../topics/core-authority-and-shared-controls.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:25
msgid ""
"The declarative AEAT registry is where source-backed assertions acquire "
"executable shape. Governed facts carry typed selectors, dated tracks, "
"source/legal references and precedence rules; model revisions declare "
"casillas, formulas, binding origins, verification expectations, "
"schedules, export layouts and extraction profiles. A "
"publication/selection gate checks predecessor graphs, explicit clears, "
"reference closure, model inception, supported year, authority grade and "
"cross-domain applicability before a filing-grade snapshot is built. "
"Historical inspection is a separate, weaker grade. The installed read-"
"only SQLite authority is selected by a descriptor with size and component"
" digests; operations lease one generation so a revision, layout and fact "
"catalogue are coherent during a calculation. The descriptor does not "
"itself prove its publisher; signed/reviewed packaging and deployment are "
"outside this report. Fact resolution "
"(`src/cadrumo/domain/calculations/registry/facts/resolution.py`), "
"snapshot gate (`src/cadrumo/domain/calculations/registry/snapshot.py`), "
"generation lease "
"(`src/cadrumo/domain/calculations/registry/authority.py`), [domain "
"topic](../topics/tax-calculation-domain.md), [analysis](../articles/137"
"-revision-selection-withholding-aggregation-and-row-provenance.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:27
msgid ""
"The authored year policy has a 2022 lower gate and a 2026 advisory "
"horizon, not a universal “everything filed through 2026” guarantee. In "
"particular, the 2026 Modelo 303 revision notes absent fresh-render "
"reproduction and legal attestation and inherited references that were not"
" re-grounded. Modelo 721 applicability data likewise does not claim a "
"complete filing service. Producer-key vocabulary can greatly exceed "
"runtime value supply: a core source documents 200 of 238 pre-existing "
"keys without runtime producers. For any named form, support has to be "
"checked at the intersection of selected revision, required bindings, "
"available source producers, approval/verification gates and actual export"
" layout. The presence of a PDF, schema or parser alone cannot fill a "
"missing producer. Year policy (`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/legal"
"/supported-filing-years.toml`), 303 revision note "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/modelos/303/revisions/2026-y-siguientes/revision.toml`),"
" producer inventory (`src/cadrumo/core/filing_producer_key.py`), "
"[knowledge topic](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-localization.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/113-external-service-constants-field-provenance-"
"and-filing-producers.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:29
msgid "Deterministic tax work and its inputs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:31
msgid ""
"The runtime source mesh converts profile facts, bank transactions, "
"invoices, registers, prior filings and operator values into separate "
"scalar, row, relation, diagnostic and provenance channels for a selected "
"Modelo/period/revision. Exclusive merge rejects two owners for one "
"binding; a declared precedence tier controls legitimate overrides. IVA "
"routes use dated regime/rate evidence, transaction direction, EUR "
"conversion, payment and prorrata. Renta uses different annual, cumulative"
" quarterly and agrarian windows, and a cash fallback is marked as such "
"rather than presented as invoice income. Withholding, M303 carry and "
"prior-filing folds have their own recognition, revision and member-"
"coverage gates. A data source can be useful for a preview without being "
"filing grade. [Aggregation topic](../topics/aggregation-and-calculation-"
"services.md), mesh "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`), IVA admission "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/_iva_transaction.py`), clean-state "
"gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/calculations/cross_period_clean_state.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/041-filing-carries-cross-period-clean-state-and-"
"calculation-advisories.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:33
msgid ""
"The formula engine is deterministic Decimal evaluation over a dependency "
"graph, with explicit rounding, dated parameters, typed channels and "
"operand/source traces. Unresolved values propagate as unresolved rather "
"than being replaced with zero. Applicability also has at least "
"applicable, affirmatively not applicable, pass-through and incomplete "
"outcomes; missing taxpayer facts do not make a confident exemption. The "
"Modelo calculation persists a content-addressed BORRADOR revision, then "
"separate verification checks manual inputs, ledger drift, prior evidence,"
" wallet and model-specific predicates. The workbench can display static "
"schema even when calculation grade was not measured. The export layer "
"selects a versioned fixed-width/XML layout, validates field geometry and "
"representable casillas, writes local bytes and rechecks them. None of "
"those steps is remote submission. Formula "
"(`src/cadrumo/domain/calculations/registry/formula_runtime.py`), "
"applicability "
"(`src/cadrumo/domain/calculations/registry/applicability.py`), "
"verification (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`), "
"[work lifecycle](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md),"
" [workbench](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-2.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/129-formula-evaluation-traceability-and-row-"
"source-bindings.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:35
msgid ""
"Taxpayer knowledge is not solely documentary. The profile schema declares"
" identity, activity, regime, family, descendant, financial and derived-"
"selector fields, including sensitivity and provenance. Its capability "
"defaults are described partly in prose, so actual consent depends on "
"settings and application gates. Family and business domain records "
"preserve dates, relationships, work months, expenses and evidence rather "
"than collapsing an eligibility question to one age or amount. Source "
"observations can still be weaker: an invoice date may proxy for devengo, "
"a transaction may need FX evidence, and a receipt CSV has only lexical "
"identity until authenticated against the taxpayer and filed record. "
"Profile and financial data are encrypted under the local bucket, while "
"authorized read models can disclose sensitive values to the operator and "
"need profile-specific output policy. Profile schema "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/cadrumo/user_profile/schema.toml`), family "
"(`src/cadrumo/domain/contribuyente/family_profile.py`), devengo "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/invoice_devengo.py`), [domain "
"topic](../topics/business-and-taxpayer-domain.md), "
"[analysis](../articles/153-usage-ratios-and-user-profile-domain.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:37
msgid "Model assistance, operator assertions and external observations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:39
msgid ""
"LLM use is concentrated in extraction, column-role mapping and "
"classification proposals. PDF text layers can use deterministic labels "
"first, while scans/images take a vision route; structured "
"Facturae/CII/UBL use exact readers. A model-proposed field has origin and"
" grounding status separately. Text anchors, numeric parsing, party "
"colocation and taxpayer-ID checks can corroborate a transcription, but a "
"matching token alone does not prove semantic role. Human confirmation re-"
"reads source bytes, binds source and review digests, resolves blocking "
"findings and records a correction as an operator assertion. For "
"classification, the model may propose business/category or split "
"proportions; dated registry arithmetic derives IVA amounts. This is a "
"boundary between probabilistic reading/judgment and deterministic tax "
"computation, not a claim that every confirmed invoice is error-free. "
"[Extraction path](../topics/ledger-invoices-and-registers.md), field "
"origin (`src/cadrumo/core/field_origin.py`), grounding "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/grounding_anchor.py`), review "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/invoice_confirmation.py`), "
"classification (`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/llm_classification.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/054-confirmation-gate-counterparty-establishment-"
"and-evidence-provenance.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:41
msgid ""
"Off-host model processing is an explicit privacy boundary. The canonical "
"evidence operation requires a stored source identity, provider/settings "
"consent for that invocation, a minted source-hash proof, loaded-byte "
"digest comparison and an audit entry before dispatch. The generic LLM "
"client alone has a weaker token-address contract; the reviewed canonical "
"path supplies the byte binding. Local model admission checks "
"memory/headroom, while hosted models require consent and may be "
"unavailable. Agent personas, casilla skill prose, terminology and "
"localized UI strings can orient an operator, but they are prompt/copy "
"material rather than executable gates. Draft/deprecated terminology and "
"mismatched sampled locale key sets need current revision and fallback "
"review before those strings are treated as legal instruction. Canonical "
"consent "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/invoice_evidence_extract_operation.py`),"
" LLM adapter (`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/llm/client.py`), agent rules"
" (`src/cadrumo_harness/_data/agent/rules/cadrumo-operator-operating-"
"rules.md`), [terminology review](../articles/205-terminology-concept-"
"corpus.md), [localization review](../articles/206-localized-interface-"
"and-model-schema-labels.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:43
msgid ""
"Remote AEAT reads are another knowledge source, not an extension of the "
"formula registry. Browser adapters use certificate or Cl@ve sessions and "
"guarded host/path/action surfaces to capture censo, declarations, wallet,"
" notification and verification observations. Stored capture manifests "
"distinguish attempted, completed, failed and genuinely empty reads; an "
"AEAT register's offered model/year options are only discovery clues "
"because their taxpayer scoping is not established. Notification document "
"fetch is guarded by a prior `leida=True` observation because opening an "
"unread notice may have legal effect. Official filing-chain evidence "
"requires a matched justificante digest, CSV, model/year/period, taxpayer "
"and current local record; a downloaded PDF alone does not suffice. Google"
" Sheets readback and ECB rates are separate external sources with their "
"own ownership/time checks and must not be described as AEAT filing "
"evidence. [AEAT adapters](../topics/external-integrations-and-local-"
"runtime.md), [live state](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), capture "
"accounting (`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_data_capture.py`), "
"notification guard "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/outbound/aeat/sede/notifications.py`), receipt "
"matching "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_observation_persistence.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-"
"surfaces.md)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/assessments/knowledge-and-provenance.md:45
msgid ""
"The strongest knowledge design is the repeated separation of source, "
"extracted content, declared rule, measured result, local act and official"
" observation. The limits are equally important. The large asset review "
"did not semantically verify all editions; current portal selectors and "
"legal rates can change; hashes do not prove publisher identity; "
"representative examples do not certify every revision; and some local "
"source/provenance checks have conditional downstream premises. The "
"highest-value assurance work is revision-specific review of actual legal "
"source and producer coverage, tests for source-fingerprint drift and "
"missing-data propagation, and end-to-end receipt reconciliation. Nothing "
"in the reviewed snapshot warrants a claim of autonomous live AEAT filing."
" [Knowledge topic](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-localization.md), "
"[domain topic](../topics/tax-calculation-domain.md), [aggregation "
"topic](../topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md), no-submit gate"
" (`src/cadrumo/core/access_gate/gate.py`), [analysis](../articles/118"
"-live-access-policy-corpus-integrity-and-decimal-contracts.md)."
msgstr ""
